 from the dependency tree\n\nSee https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/19665 for a prototype of the\nLSP integration.", "tree": {"sha": "757e0ae2a3017452e928c43616b201063e305528", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/git/trees/757e0ae2a3017452e928c43616b201063e305528"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/astral-sh/uv/git/commits/e31f000da7a5b98c1832b2667316730a30fe3341", "verification": {"payload": "tree 757e0ae2a3017452e928c43616b201063e305528\nparent 8d6ea3f2ea3255acdd91f7b618014aef95f7b393\nauthor Zanie Blue <contact@zanie.dev> 1755775998 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1755775998 -0500\n\nAdd an experimental `uv format` command (#15017)\n\nAs a frontend to Ruff's formatter.\n\nThere are some interesting choices here, some of which may just be\ntemporary:\n\n1. We pin a default version of Ruff, so `uv format` is stable for a\ngiven uv version\n2. We install Ruff from GitHub instead of PyPI, which means we don't\nneed a Python interpreter or environment\n3. We do not read the Ruff version from the dependency tree\n\nSee https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/pull/19665 for a prototype of the\nLSP integration.", "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJopwP+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZb4QAI2DLH5wlWG1uT6cGvvnKa78\n1nt2nyHei22ITIOyazy4kuB5Fz+E/IiEhXoueVBW4BGUpYYq6ilk6XSYJJo9RAzH\ndhCMx8lFMvHxShOEyO4nghi4dNShvVnxdE3/GMOOH4IpojdJ5OYcgkXA56bx1EMV\nYutnheV9p+iQ3jyTpyszrld3j160RIu7gqgDgVKgySWtCB1rL6CBlQkOZH1agtuO\ncN7QyHceHSGP+U6NNYxbeO+o8/WaRvgx7usYl9eQcChxJYIG0LQofrJ6jhbVeVRU\nD+RqHbV/s6ceUKH8j2x8N0nGeaEpWVXm1ud0RimbLzmzdhy34+nf254M8VFADFxB\nHGTv0Jj0AHcMYc8q7+CHGO8Gsp7Qff6A4f9b9yEF+QFg303XD7xd90QpQk/lKWRM\n6TszhFFrpBZPDBJaLEaLkPGGaFvqB1z9GmjdPrgtkesgns7mrY4IVfi+On4aH4ft\nx+OUDx34jAVfdH6LT4hkPkrRVA9Db78owTlMPYz34EQAVzTXR159nXc7aL7I85/4\nEu2V3K02A/jeT4p1m2zltZvo5kLbd293AV7oP4xbahybuwYjejnE/wpRyEQYNgUO\ndx7kdO+1CFxDJDvEJUociF3Bl+CaT/Y2fIrbteTDxbMyw/Ghb9BZLCoNmA1IJvgE\ng/huY+fYT1IdlxUiMU0t\n=hNdX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE--